{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Trader Simulator</strong> is the ultimate video game resale experience. You are the curator of a growing business that spans both the digital and physical world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Organize with Care</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sort your growing collection of games and neatly organize them into boxes, labeling and arranging everything in alphabetical order for quick access and efficient packing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702040/extras/c2fbf6352dda91983d2b5722c0d8347e.poster.avif?t=1772508281\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702040/extras/c2fbf6352dda91983d2b5722c0d8347e.webm?t=1772508281\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702040/extras/c2fbf6352dda91983d2b5722c0d8347e.mp4?t=1772508281\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Know your customer\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your business grows, manage your inventory, learn buyer preferences, and recommend the perfect titles to loyal customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702040/extras/950188f040971b6c589b54a58993935e.poster.avif?t=1772508281\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702040/extras/950188f040971b6c589b54a58993935e.webm?t=1772508281\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702040/extras/950188f040971b6c589b54a58993935e.mp4?t=1772508281\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pack and Prosper</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pack large orders carefully to keep customers happy and expand your growing used game store.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702040/extras/49609c02ae5ddfadd4ff25334c8b74b5.poster.avif?t=1772508281\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702040/extras/49609c02ae5ddfadd4ff25334c8b74b5.webm?t=1772508281\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702040/extras/49609c02ae5ddfadd4ff25334c8b74b5.mp4?t=1772508281\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In &quot;<strong>Game Trader Simulator</strong>&quot;\u00a0Relive the golden days of gaming as you fulfill orders and pass on nostalgia, one box at a time.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3702040?t=1772508281","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3702040?t=1772508281","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702040/996c37279a2376faf2606fc3eb12252cdea0f414/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772508281","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702040/996c37279a2376faf2606fc3eb12252cdea0f414/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772508281","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><stron